OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms working off Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FArgentina's President, Javier Milei,
OL,7,Fhas heightened tensions with the UK
OL,8,Fover the Falklands, warning he will
OL,9,Fimpose economic sanctions on firms
OL,10,Fwhich exploit oil close to the British
OL,11,Foverseas territory.
OL,13,FIn a national address, Milei said the
OL,14,F"winds of change" favoured Argentina's
OL,15,Fclaim to the islands, emboldened by
OL,16,Fsigns the US might reconsider its
OL,17,Fstance of neutrality on the issue.
OL,19,FMilei said the Sea Lion oilfield, where
OL,20,Fa British and an Israeli firm are due
OL,21,Fto begin exploration work, was a "clear
OL,22,Fand present danger".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
