OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms working off Falklands
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 40 years after the war over
OL,7,Fthe territory, sovereignty of the
OL,8,Farchipelago in the south-west Atlantic
OL,9,FOcean remains hotly disputed between
OL,10,FBritain and Argentina.
